the suite fails on my Mac — 5 test files, one root cause. When Swift is parsed, V8's background WASM tier-up crashes the process at exit (Fatal process out of memory: Zone, exit 133) on this Mac's Node v24.15, because --liftoff-only set mid-process via v8.setFlagsFromString doesn't take effect there. Set at process startup (node --liftoff-only …), it exits 0. Move the flag to process start; the proof is npm test green on this Mac, not just your container.